{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Office After Hours is a frightening and sometimes humorous spot the difference anomaly game with a mysterious story.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You just want to go home. Why are you still here?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your boss has insisted on extra overtime and now you're stuck in the office after work. Keep an eye out for strange occurrences and you might find your way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207300/extras/OfficeLoopNew-ezgif.com-speed.gif?t=1745251098\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Spot anomalies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During your shift, the office will change and you will discover a lot of work, coffee and, if you are lucky, the office pet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207300/extras/DinoAnomalyGif-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1745251098\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Escape the overwork hell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To escape from Endless Solutions, you must find clues that will give you access to new areas and reveal new secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you find all the numbers and collect the story-related items?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207300/extras/CluesGif-ezgif.com-speed.gif?t=1745251098\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Can you escape?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30 Story based anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40+ Anomalies in total</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Working hours</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">~1 hour (+overtime)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207300/extras/WishlistNow.gif?t=1745251098\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3207300?t=1745251098","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207300/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745251098","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207300/f86eb47441426ab33c0f76286e8ca0a16f661aa7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745251098","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207300/f86eb47441426ab33c0f76286e8ca0a16f661aa7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745251098","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains themes and imagery that are related to overwork."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3265400,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Office After Hours is a frightening and sometimes humorous spot the difference anomaly game with a mysterious story.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You just want to go home. Why are you still here?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your boss has insisted on extra overtime and now you're stuck in the office after work. Keep an eye out for strange occurrences and you might find your way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207300/extras/OfficeLoopNew-ezgif.com-speed.gif?t=1745251098\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Spot anomalies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During your shift, the office will change and you will discover a lot of work, coffee and, if you are lucky, the office pet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shar